===================================================================
Redis 8.12-RC1 (v8.11.240)    Released Thu 29 Oct 2026 14:00:00 IST
===================================================================

This is the first Release Candidate of Redis 8.12 in Redis Open Source.

Release Candidates are feature-complete pre-releases. Pre-releases are not suitable for production use.

### Headlines:

Redis 8.12 introduces new features and performance improvements.

### Operating systems we test Redis 8.12 on [need review]

- Ubuntu 22.04 (Jammy Jellyfish), 24.04 (Noble Numbat), 26.04 (Resolute Raccoon)
- Rocky Linux 8.10, 9.7, 10.1
- AlmaLinux 8.10, 9.7, 10.1
- Debian 12.13 (Bookworm), Debian 13.4 (Trixie)
- Alpine 3.23
- macOS 14.8.4 (Sonoma), 15.7.4 (Sequoia), 26.3 (Tahoe) - for both Intel and ARM

### Security fixes
- RediSearch/RediSearch#10073 Indexed value hashing is now collision-resistant, preventing HashDoS-style index degradation from adversarial input. (MOD-14459)
- RediSearch/RediSearch#11202 Incomplete UTF-8 characters no longer reads out of bounds in indexed TEXT fields. (MOD-18088)

### New Features

- #15331 Compressed bitmaps — Integrated redis-roaring into Redis core for lower memory usage and faster bitmap operations. 
Special thanks to Antonio, the original creator of redis-roaring, for contributing this capability! https://redisroaring.com/redis-merge/#/1; 
- #15986 New command: `BITRANGEINTARRAY` equivalent to redis-roaring’s `R.RANGEINTARRAY`, to return set bit offsets within a specified range
- #15938 Set expiration to individual set member; New commands: `SEXPIRE`,`SPEXPIRE`,`SEXPIREAT`,`SPEXPIREAT` to set expiration and `STTL`, `SPTTL`, `SEXPIRETIME`,`SPEXPIRETIME` to retrieve remaining TTLs or expiration timestamps
- #15828 Bless keys: avoid eviction of specified keys; New command: `BLESS`
- #15829 `CLUSTER MIGRATION STATUS` now reports progress for both the snapshot and incremental migration phases
- #15556 `TLS` named groups can now be configured using `tls-groups`
- RedisBloom/RedisBloom#17398 Count-min-sketch extensions: Added optional `CELL_SIZE` support to `CMS.INITBYDIM` and `CMS.INITBYPROB` for lower memory usage, negative increments in `CMS.INCRBY` to decrement counts, and cell size reporting in `CMS.INFO`
- RedisJSON/RedisJSON#1640 Auto-create JSON deep path 
- RediSearch/RediSearch#10151 `EXPLAINSCORE` is now supported for `FT.HYBRID`. (MOD-10044)
- RediSearch/RediSearch#11330 SQ8 new compression is now available for HNSW vector fields. (MOD-6132)
- RediSearch/RediSearch#10247 `RETURN_STRICT` timeout handling is now enabled for local `FT.HYBRID` execution. (MOD-16492)
- RediSearch/RediSearch#11278 `FT.ALTER` avoids unnecessary document reindexing during schema additions. (MOD-18171)
- RediSearch/RediSearch#11384 Score/payload-only hash updates avoid reindexing. (MOD-18182)
- RediSearch/RediSearch#11230 Hash documents are no longer re-indexed when no vector indexed field is touched. (MOD-17688)

