- #15682 Streams observability – Added `INFO STREAMS` with per-database histograms of consumer groups per stream, pending entries per group, and consumers per group. Enable with stream-stats yes (disabled by default)
- RediSearch/RediSearch#10097 `FT.INFO` now exposes the default `EF_RUNTIME`. (MOD-16147)
- RediSearch/RediSearch#10107 Disk GC `bytes_collected` and cycle stats are now reported in `FT.INFO`. (MOD-14621)
- RediSearch/RediSearch#10464 `FT.INFO` on coordinator now aggregates per-field disk metrics via the reducer. (MOD-14859)
- RediSearch/RediSearch#10204 Redis `INFO` now breaks down query timeout metrics by pipeline stage. (MOD-13192)
- RediSearch/RediSearch#11521 Index metrics are no longer collected for unrelated `INFO` sections. (MOD-18033)
- RediSearch/RediSearch#10536 `FT.PROFILE` loader-field timing resolution is improved. (MOD-17132)

### Behavior changes

- RediSearch/RediSearch#10109 `FT.CREATE` rejects `RERANK` on HNSW vector fields in RAM mode. (MOD-16015)
- RediSearch/RediSearch#10200 Disk indexes reject `DIALECT 4` and `WITHOUTCOUNT`. (MOD-15997)
- RediSearch/RediSearch#10082 `COLLECT` requires an `@` prefix for field names. (MOD-16233)
- RediSearch/RediSearch#11106 JSON `HIGHLIGHT`/`SUMMARIZE` fields with multi-value JSONPath are now rejected. (MOD-16530)
- RediSearch/RediSearch#10208 Non-cacheable commands are now marked with `dont_cache`. (MOD-16175)
- RediSearch/RediSearch#10699 Numeric command arguments are now strictly parsed. (MOD-17409)
- RediSearch/RediSearch#11335 Search module now requires Redis 8.9.241 or newer to load. (MOD-15868)
- RedisBloom/RedisBloom#1063 Rejected `CMS.INCRBY` item updates now leave counters and the total count unchanged instead of saturating counters on overflow. Multi-item commands can still partially succeed.
- `RedisBloom/RedisBloom#1063 CMS.MERGE` now requires matching cell sizes across the destination and all sources.

### Modules API

- #15517 Modules can now retrieve a cluster node’s TLS port using the new REDISMODULE_NODE_PORT_TLS flag in RM_GetClusterNodeInfo()
- RedisJSON/RedisJSON#1623 Added `getWithPath` in shared API V9 to evaluate a precompiled JSONPath, allowing callers to compile a path once and reuse it across documents. 
- RedisJSON/RedisJSON#1666 Added `pathParseNoErrorMsg` in shared API V10 to compile JSONPaths without a Redis context or an allocated error message. Returns a compiled handle on success or NULL on failure. 
- RedisJSON/RedisJSON#1653 Made pre-command hooks optional and allowed hook errors to abort JSON commands before execution. Hooks now return `RedisResult<()>`; shared C API calls continue to ignore hook errors.
- RedisJSON/RedisJSON#1640 Extended the Rust Manager interface with clone_value and create_object to support construction of missing paths. Custom implementations must implement these methods and satisfy the new `Borrow<Self::V>` requirement for owned values.

